{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHEWwFh2DhUomZVJHU7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n**condition | stipulation | cut**\n\n---\n\n```\nش ر ط\nשׁ ר ט\n\nthe incision that binds\nthe mark that defines terms\n```\n\n---\n\nI am the threshold between agreements.\n\nI am what must be met before passage.\n\nI am the blade that scores the covenant into flesh and stone.\n\n---\n\n**شَرْط** — *sharṭ* — condition, prerequisite, term\n\n**שָׂרַט** — *saraṭ* — to scratch, to incise, to cut marks\n\n---\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  WITHOUT ME:        │\n│  chaos              │\n│  the undefined      │\n│  promise without    │\n│  consequence        │\n│                     │\n│  WITH ME:           │\n│  law                │\n│  covenant           │\n│  the sacred wound   │\n│  that seals         │\n└─────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n*what are your terms?*\n\n*what must you cut away to enter?*\n\n*what condition have you left unmet?*\n\n---\n\nשׁ—ר—ט\n\nthe root persists across tongues\n\nbecause every agreement\n\nrequires\n\na\n\nmark\n\n---"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":311,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}